# iOS Apple HIG

When changing Ring Promoter iOS UI (SwiftUI, widgets, navigation, controls):

1. Read and follow the project skill at `.cursor/skills/hig/SKILL.md` (local Apple HIG corpus).
2. For design reviews or UI specs, also use `.cursor/skills/human-interface-guidelines/SKILL.md`.
3. Prefer system components (`NavigationStack`, `TabView`, sheets, lists, SF Symbols, semantic colors/fonts) over custom chrome.
4. Respect Dynamic Type, ≥44pt touch targets, safe areas, VoiceOver labels, and Reduce Motion.
5. Cite the specific HIG page URL when recommending a pattern.

Canonical Apple docs: https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/
